1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,816
UbiGraph brings urban analysis and specialist Agents into one shared workspace.

2
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:11,598
A question calls the local forecast model and spatial analysis tools.

3
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:16,370
Explore the returned spatial relationships.

4
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:22,164
Inspect another replay time for missing observations and collection recommendations.

5
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:27,078
For simulation, the user supplies targets and reviews the plan.

6
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:31,504
Inspect the structured flight commands.

7
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:40,668
Execute the reviewed simulation. Routes and fleet state update as the mission runs. This replay is accelerated.

8
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:47,316
Review completed tasks and their action receipts.

9
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:50,236
Inspect model settings.

10
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:58,978
A separate physical demonstration follows the same interaction pattern. Start by previewing a mission in the
conversation.

11
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:07,468
Connect the selected aircraft without takeoff, then inspect the connection result.

12
00:01:13,250 --> 00:01:17,114
The user explicitly authorizes the saved physical mission.

13
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:23,808
The Agent calls the flight tool and generates its response in the conversation.

14
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:35,852
The conversation stays visible beside the aircraft footage and reviewed route. Physical flight is shown at its
original speed.

15
00:01:48,100 --> 00:01:55,228
While flight continues, the user asks the Agent for the final backend report, without starting another flight.

16
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:07,904
Watch the return and landing. The page keeps recording while the physical mission completes.

17
00:02:22,750 --> 00:02:31,726
Finally, watch the report generate. It records command completion, takeoff and landing checks, and the limits of
what was verified.

18
00:02:34,750 --> 00:02:39,646
UbiGraph: analysis, reviewed action, and traceable results.
